msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Statistics"
msgstr "穩健統計"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust versions of classical statistical analyses"
msgstr "經典統計分析方法的穩健版本"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Classical Analyses"
msgstr "穩健經典分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust ANOVA"
msgstr "穩健方差分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Repeated Measures ANOVA"
msgstr "穩健重複測量方差分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust ANCOVA"
msgstr "穩健協方差分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Linear Regression"
msgstr "穩健線性迴歸"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Robust Correlation"
msgstr "穩健相關"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"Robust ANCOVA compares trimmed means of exactly two groups while adjusting for"
"a covariate, using a nonparametric running interval smoother. No parametric"
"assumptions about homogeneity of regression slopes or equal variances are"
"required. Without a covariate, a robust one-way ANOVA is performed instead."
msgstr ""
"穩健協方差分析使用非引數滑動區間平滑器，在調整協變數的同時比較恰好兩個組的截尾均值。"
"無需關於迴歸斜率同質性或方差相等的引數假設。當沒有協變數時，則執行穩健單因素方差分析。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "假設"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "The independent variable is categorical with exactly two levels."
msgstr "自變數為分型別，且恰好具有兩個水平。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "The dependent variable and covariate are continuous."
msgstr "因變數和協變數為連續型。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "The groups are independent."
msgstr "各組是獨立的。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Dependent Variable"
msgstr "因變數"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "The continuous outcome variable."
msgstr "連續結果變數。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Fixed Factor"
msgstr "固定因子"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "A categorical grouping variable with exactly two levels."
msgstr "恰好具有兩個水平的分型別分組變數。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Covariate"
msgstr "協變數"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "An optional continuous covariate to adjust for."
msgstr "用於調整的可選連續協變數。"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Additional Statistics"
msgstr "附加統計"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "描述統計"

msgctxt "AncovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"Per-group sample size, trimmed mean, median, Winsorized standard deviation,"
"and median absolute deviation for the dependent variable and each covariate."
msgstr ""
"因變數和每個協變數的每組樣本量、截尾均值、中位數、溫索化標準差和中位數絕對偏差。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid ""
"Robust Repeated Measures ANOVA analyzes differences between dependent group"
"means using robust methods from the WRS2 package. No assumptions of normality,"
"homogeneity, or sphericity are required."
msgstr ""
"穩健重複測量方差分析使用WRS2包中的穩健方法來分析相關組均值之間的差異。"
"無需正態性、同質性或球形性假設。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "假設"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "The dependent variable is continuous."
msgstr "因變數為連續型。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Repeated Measures Factor"
msgstr "重複測量因子"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "RM Factor"
msgstr "重複測量因子"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Repeated Measures Cells"
msgstr "重複測量單元格"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Between Subject Factor"
msgstr "被試間因子"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Optional single between-subjects grouping variable for mixed designs."
msgstr "用於混合設計的可選單一被試間分組變數。"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Additional Statistics"
msgstr "附加統計"

msgctxt "AnovaRepeatedMeasuresRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "描述統計"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"Robust ANOVA analyzes differences between group means using robust methods"
"from the WRS2 package. These methods do not assume normality or homogeneity of"
"variances."
msgstr ""
"穩健方差分析使用WRS2包中的穩健方法來分析組均值之間的差異。"
"這些方法不假設正態性或方差齊性。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "假設"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid ""
"The independent variables are categorical, the dependent variable is"
"continuous."
msgstr "自變數為分型別，因變數為連續型。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "The groups are independent."
msgstr "各組是獨立的。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Dependent Variable"
msgstr "因變數"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "The continuous outcome variable."
msgstr "連續結果變數。"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Fixed Factors"
msgstr "固定因子"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Additional Statistics"
msgstr "附加統計"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "描述統計"

msgctxt "AnovaRobust|"
msgid "Robust effect sizes"
msgstr "穩健效應量"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "假設"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "變數"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Two or more continuous variables. All pairwise robust correlations are"
"reported."
msgstr "兩個或更多連續變數。報告所有成對的穩健相關係數。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Options"
msgstr "選項"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Percentage bend correlation downweights values in the tails. Winsorized"
"correlation replaces extreme values with less extreme ones before computing"
"the correlation."
msgstr ""
"百分比彎曲相關對尾部的值進行降權。溫索化相關在計算相關之前用不太極端的值替換極端值。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Percentage bend"
msgstr "百分比彎曲"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Winsorized"
msgstr "溫索化"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Trimming proportion"
msgstr "截尾比例"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Bending constant β for percentage bend correlation, or Winsorization"
"proportion for the Winsorized correlation. Also used for the descriptives"
"table. Default is 0.2."
msgstr ""
"百分比彎曲相關的彎曲常數β，或溫索化相關的溫索化比例。也用於描述統計表。預設值為0.2。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Sample size"
msgstr "樣本量"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Display the number of complete pairwise observations used in each correlation."
msgstr "顯示每個相關中使用的完整成對觀測的數量。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Flag significant correlations"
msgstr "標記顯著相關"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "描述統計"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Per-variable sample size, trimmed mean, median, Winsorized standard deviation,"
"and median absolute deviation."
msgstr "每個變數的樣本量、截尾均值、中位數、溫索化標準差和中位數絕對偏差。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Alternative hypothesis"
msgstr "備擇假設"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Specify the directional hypothesis used to compute the p-value of each"
"correlation."
msgstr "指定用於計算每個相關的p值的方向性假設。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Test whether the correlation differs from zero in either direction."
msgstr "檢驗相關是否在任一方向上與零不同。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Positively correlated"
msgstr "正相關"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Test whether the correlation is greater than zero."
msgstr "檢驗相關是否大於零。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Negatively correlated"
msgstr "負相關"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Test whether the correlation is less than zero."
msgstr "檢驗相關是否小於零。"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "圖表"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid "Scatter plots"
msgstr "散點圖"

msgctxt "CorrelationRobust|"
msgid ""
"Displays scatter plots with marginal density plots and a linear regression"
"line for each pair of variables."
msgstr ""
"為每對變數顯示帶有邊際密度圖和線性迴歸線的散點圖。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "假設"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Dependent Variable"
msgstr "因變數"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "The continuous outcome variable to be regressed on the predictors."
msgstr "要在預測變數上進行迴歸的連續結果變數。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "協變數"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Continuous predictors entered as numeric covariates."
msgstr "作為數值協變數輸入的連續預測變數。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "因子"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Categorical predictors. Each factor is dummy coded with the first level as the"
"reference."
msgstr "分型別預測變數。每個因子以第一個水平為參照進行虛擬編碼。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Estimation method"
msgstr "估計方法"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "MM-estimation"
msgstr "MM估計"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Coefficients"
msgstr "係數"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Estimates"
msgstr "估計值"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Display the estimated regression coefficients with standard errors, Wald"
"t-statistics, and p-values."
msgstr "顯示帶標準誤、Wald t統計量和p值的估計迴歸係數。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "置信區間"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Display Wald-type confidence intervals for the regression coefficients at the"
"chosen confidence level."
msgstr "在所選置信水平下顯示迴歸係數的Wald型置信區間。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Descriptives"
msgstr "描述統計"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Per-variable sample size, trimmed mean, median, Winsorized standard deviation,"
"and median absolute deviation for the dependent variable and each covariate."
"The trimming proportion is used only for these descriptives; the robust"
"regression fit itself uses the chosen estimation method."
msgstr ""
"因變數和每個協變數的每個變數的樣本量、截尾均值、中位數、溫索化標準差和中位數絕對偏差。"
"截尾比例僅用於這些描述統計；穩健迴歸擬合本身使用所選估計方法。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Trimming proportion"
msgstr "截尾比例"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Trimming proportion used for the trimmed mean and Winsorized SD in the"
"descriptives table. Default is 0.2."
msgstr "用於描述統計表中的截尾均值和溫索化標準差的截尾比例。預設值為0.2。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "圖表"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Residual Plots"
msgstr "殘差圖"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Residuals vs. fitted"
msgstr "殘差對擬合值"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals against fitted values with a loess smoother to inspect non-"
"linearity or heteroscedasticity that survives the robust fit."
msgstr ""
"使用loess平滑器繪製殘差對擬合值，以檢查穩健擬合後仍存在的非線性或異方差性。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Q-Q plot of residuals"
msgstr "殘差的Q-Q圖"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid ""
"Normal quantile-quantile plot of the standardised residuals to assess the"
"residual distribution."
msgstr "標準化殘差的正態分位數-分位數圖，用於評估殘差分佈。"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Other Plots"
msgstr "其他圖表"

msgctxt "RegressionLinearRobust|"
msgid "Robust weights"
msgstr "穩健權重"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Residuals"
msgstr "殘差"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Displays descriptive statistics of the residuals and predicted values."
msgstr "顯示殘差和預測值的描述統計。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Casewise diagnostics"
msgstr "逐案例診斷"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Std. residual >"
msgstr "標準化殘差 >"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Cook's dist. >"
msgstr "Cook距離 >"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "DFBETAS"
msgstr "DFBETAS"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid ""
"The difference between a parameter estimated using all cases and estimated"
"when one case is excluded. Indicated in the table when the absolute value of"
"DFBETAS is greater than 1."
msgstr ""
"使用所有案例估計的引數與排除一個案例後估計的引數之間的差異。當DFBETAS的絕對值大於1時在表中標出。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "DFFITS"
msgstr "DFFITS"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Cov ratio"
msgstr "協變比"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Leverage"
msgstr "槓桿值"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid ""
"The influence of the observed value of the outcome variable over the predicted"
"values. Indicated in the table when the leverage is greater than 3 * k/n."
msgstr ""
"結果變數的觀測值對預測值的影響。當槓桿值大於3 * k/n時在表中標出。"

msgctxt "OutlierComponent|"
msgid "Mahalanobis"
msgstr "馬氏距離"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Raincloud Plots"
msgstr "雨雲圖"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "因子"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "The independent variables included in the analysis."
msgstr "分析中包含的自變數。"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Horizontal Axis"
msgstr "水平軸"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid ""
"Select the independent variable that should be displayed on the horizontal"
"axis of the plot."
msgstr "選擇應顯示在圖水平軸上的自變數。"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Separate Plots"
msgstr "分圖"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid ""
"By placing an independent variable in this box, different plots corresponding"
"to the different levels of the independent variable will be displayed."
msgstr "在此框中放入自變數，將顯示與該自變數的不同水平對應的不同圖表。"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Horizontal display"
msgstr "水平顯示"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid ""
"Changes the orientation of the raincloud difference plot so that the x-axis"
"represents the dependent variable."
msgstr "更改雨雲差異圖的方向，使x軸表示因變數。"

msgctxt "RainCloudPlots|"
msgid "Label y-axis"
msgstr "y軸標籤"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid ""
"Specify the robust estimation method and its parameters. All methods are based"
"on the WRS2 package."
msgstr "指定穩健估計方法及其引數。所有方法都基於WRS2包。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid ""
"Trimmed Means + Bootstrap: A percentile t-bootstrap version of the trimmed"
"means test."
msgstr "截尾均值 + 自助法：截尾均值檢驗的百分位t自助法版本。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid ""
"Medians: A heteroscedastic ANOVA based on medians using the Harrell-Davis"
"estimator."
msgstr "中位數：使用Harrell-Davis估計器基於中位數的異方差方差分析。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Select the robust estimation method to use for the analysis."
msgstr "選擇用於分析的穩健估計方法。"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Trimmed Means"
msgstr "截尾均值"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Trimmed Means + Bootstrap"
msgstr "截尾均值 + 自助法"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Medians"
msgstr "中位數"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Trimming proportion"
msgstr "截尾比例"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "Bootstrap samples"
msgstr "自助法樣本"

msgctxt "RobustOptions|"
msgid "The number of bootstrap resamples to use. Default is 599."
msgstr "要使用的自助法重取樣數。預設值為599。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Descriptives Plots"
msgstr "描述統計圖"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"To create a descriptive plot, select the independent variable to be placed on"
"the horizontal axis. If there are more than one independent variable, they can"
"be visualized in a single plot by placing the second variable in 'Separate"
"Lines,' or visualized in separate plots by placing the variable in 'Separate"
"Plots'."
msgstr ""
"要建立描述統計圖，請選擇要放在水平軸上的自變數。如果不止一個自變數，可將第二個變數放入"
"'分線'以在單個圖表中顯示，或將變數放入'分圖'以在單獨的圖表中顯示。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "因子"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "The independent variables included in the analysis."
msgstr "分析中包含的自變數。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Horizontal Axis"
msgstr "水平軸"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"Select the independent variable that should be displayed on the horizontal"
"axis of the plot."
msgstr "選擇應顯示在圖水平軸上的自變數。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Separate Lines"
msgstr "分線"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"By placing an independent variable in this box, different lines corresponding"
"to the different levels of the independent variable will be displayed."
msgstr "在此框中放入自變數，將顯示與該自變數的不同水平對應的不同線條。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Separate Plots"
msgstr "分圖"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"By placing an independent variable in this box, different plots corresponding"
"to the different levels of the independent variable will be displayed."
msgstr "在此框中放入自變數，將顯示與該自變數的不同水平對應的不同圖表。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Display"
msgstr "顯示"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Error bars"
msgstr "誤差線"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid ""
"Display error bars in the plot. The error bars can represent either confidence"
"intervals or standard errors."
msgstr "在圖中顯示誤差線。誤差線可以表示置信區間或標準誤。"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Confidence interval"
msgstr "置信區間"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Standard error"
msgstr "標準誤"

msgctxt "DescriptivePlots|"
msgid "Normalize error bars"
msgstr "標準化誤差線"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Post Hoc Tests"
msgstr "事後檢驗"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Correction"
msgstr "校正"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid ""
"To correct for multiple comparisons, various methods are available for"
"adjusting the p-value. Note: corrections are applied when supported by the"
"chosen robust post hoc method."
msgstr ""
"為校正多重比較，有多種調整p值的方法可用。注意：校正僅在所選穩健事後檢驗方法支援時應用。"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Hochberg"
msgstr "Hochberg"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Bonferroni"
msgstr "Bonferroni"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid ""
"This correction is considered conservative. The risk of Type I error is"
"reduced, however the statistical power decreases as well."
msgstr ""
"該校正被視為保守。雖然降低了第一類錯誤的風險，但統計功效也會隨之降低。"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid "Holm"
msgstr "Holm"

msgctxt "PostHoc|"
msgid ""
"Also called sequential Bonferroni, and considered less conservative than the"
"Bonferroni method."
msgstr "也稱為序貫Bonferroni，被認為比Bonferroni方法保守程度更低。"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid "Display"
msgstr "顯示"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "置信區間"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, the confidence interval for the trimmed mean"
"difference is displayed."
msgstr "選擇此選項時，將顯示截尾均值差異的置信區間。"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid "Flag significant comparisons"
msgstr "標記顯著比較"

msgctxt "PostHocDisplay|"
msgid "Add asterisks to the table to indicate 3 levels of significance."
msgstr "在表格中新增星號以表示3個顯著性水平。"
